<title>USA: Houston Industries Q1 shr profit $0.26.</title>
<headline>Houston Industries Q1 shr profit $0.26.</headline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				   Quarter Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>				   March 31,		March 31,</p>
<p>			     1997	  1996	1997	 1996</p>
<p> Revenues	    $878,101    $823,507 $4,148,525 $3,797,110</p>
<p>Income from Continuing</p>
<p>  Operations	    59,620   ( 16,740)   481,304    356,811</p>
<p> Net Income	     59,620   ( 16,740)   481,304    974,328</p>
