<p>Weighted Average Common Shares   Outstanding	  233,689     248,466   240,789    248,021</p>
<p>NOTES: The first quarter 1997 improvement was due primarily to lower operating expenses and preferred dividends at the company's Houston Light &amp; Power Co unit and improved results at its Houston Industries Energy Inc unit.</p>
<p>First quarter 1996 earnings included non-recurring after-tax charges of $62 million taken in connection with the settlement of litigation claims relating to the South Texas Project nuclear plant and $5 million associated wity HI Energy's investment in two tire-to-energy plants in Illinois. Excluding the charges, first quarter 1996 earnings would have been $50 million or $0.20 per share.</p>
